  <div class="sl-hero-text">
    <p class="sl-hero-desc">Encrypt any secret — API keys, passwords, credentials, or notes — with a passphrase using AES-GCM. Share the encrypted ciphertext freely over email, Slack, or any channel. Only someone with your passphrase can unlock it.</p>
  </div>
